cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use swathcast, please cite it as below."
title: "swathcast: upcoming satellite acquisitions and time until data delivery"
abstract: >-
  Upcoming acquisitions for Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Landsat 8/9 and NISAR, read from the agencies'
  own acquisition plans and resolved to native footprints (bursts, tiles, scenes, frames), plus
  data delivery latency at each distributor measured by an hourly poller and summarized with
  Kaplan-Meier estimates.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Eric
    family-names: Gagliano
    affiliation: University of Washington
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4362-6260"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/egagli/swathcast"
url: "https://egagli.github.io/swathcast/"
keywords:
  - Sentinel-1
  - Sentinel-2
  - Landsat
  - NISAR
  - acquisition plans
  - data latency
  - remote sensing
